stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> ApprovedBaseline
  ApprovedBaseline --> Comparing: new user instruction
  Comparing --> ApprovedBaseline: compatible / unknown-low-risk
  Comparing --> DiscussionPending: conflict / new requirement / high-uncertainty
  DiscussionPending --> Investigation: option D
  Investigation --> DiscussionPending: more evidence
  DiscussionPending --> Maintain: option A
  DiscussionPending --> Experiment: option C
  DiscussionPending --> RevisionProposed: option B
  Maintain --> ApprovedBaseline: update downstream files only
  Experiment --> ApprovedBaseline: experimental work isolated
  RevisionProposed --> ProposedBaseline: revise requirements + init
  ProposedBaseline --> ApprovedBaseline: human approval + protected PR review
